# Bothea v2 — repository hygiene
# Required by docs/sync.md §6 and asserted by `bothea sync doctor`.
#
# `-text` disables every end-of-line conversion in both directions, so a file
# written in the NixOS guest is byte-identical when read on the Windows host.
# Do not change this line; prototype under S2 proved that CRLF/LF translation
# turns a 200-file round trip into 200 phantom conflicts.

* -text
